  "description": "Normal final-boss theme — Reina Kurogane, 'The Surveyor' (Normal S30, Amanagi Dawnline). Precise, cold and driving: 156 BPM in C# minor with a Phrygian D, a machine-steady sixteenth bass, tight electro drums, gated supersaw stabs and glassy FM. The Survey Grid becomes her full hook — rising perfect fourths, then a semitone fall — in a square-lead verse, a quartal pre-chorus, a relentless chorus, a lonely bell breakdown of stacked fourths ('solitary precision'), an eight-bar build and a final chorus with strings.",
